    message: Welcome to the Hardware Library! Browse categories vertically and swipe
      each row sideways. Earn Gold in lessons to unlock their items.
  - target: {fileID: 934760467}
    message: After this tour, tap an item to see its details here. Unlocked items
      show a description and model preview; locked items show the lesson needed to
      unlock them.
  - target: {fileID: 770417858}
    message: Check Compatibility compares your chosen motherboard, CPU, RAM, and
      GPU. All listed parts are available here, even without lesson unlocks or 3D
      models.
  - target: {fileID: 1157981727}
    message: Open AR Sandbox to place and explore your unlocked items. Unlock at
      least one item first. You're ready to try the library!
